{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type DefaultFormGroupOptions = Pick<FormGroupOptions<unknown, string, unknown, FormGroupValidators<unknown>, FormErrorTypes>, \"onSubmitInvalid\">;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L114","children":[{"type":"text","value":"defaultOptions.public.ts:114"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reusable form-group behavior that does not participate in group value\ninference."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmitInvalid"},{"type":"text","value":" can be shared this way. Its callback receives\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":" form and group values, so value-dependent behavior should remain\nin the usage-site form-group options. A usage-site "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmitInvalid"},{"type":"text","value":"\nproperty overrides the default even when explicitly set to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const formGroupDefaults: DefaultFormGroupOptions = {\n  onSubmitInvalid: ({ groupApi }) => {\n    console.error('Invalid group', groupApi.name)\n  },\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DefaultFormGroupOptions = Pick<FormGroupOptions<unknown, string, unknown, FormGroupValidators<unknown>, FormErrorTypes>, \"onSubmitInvalid\">;\n```\n\nDefined in: [defaultOptions.public.ts:114](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L114)\n\nReusable form-group behavior that does not participate in group value\ninference.\n\nOnly `onSubmitInvalid` can be shared this way. Its callback receives\n`unknown` form and group values, so value-dependent behavior should remain\nin the usage-site form-group options. A usage-site `onSubmitInvalid`\nproperty overrides the default even when explicitly set to `undefined`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst formGroupDefaults: DefaultFormGroupOptions = {\n  onSubmitInvalid: ({ groupApi }) => {\n    console.error('Invalid group', groupApi.name)\n  },\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DefaultFormGroupOptions\ntitle: DefaultFormGroupOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DefaultFormGroupOptions = Pick<FormGroupOptions<unknown, string, unknown, FormGroupValidators<unknown>, FormErrorTypes>, \"onSubmitInvalid\">;\n```\n\nDefined in: [defaultOptions.public.ts:114](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/defaultOptions.public.ts#L114)\n\nReusable form-group behavior that does not participate in group value\ninference.\n\nOnly `onSubmitInvalid` can be shared this way. Its callback receives\n`unknown` form and group values, so value-dependent behavior should remain\nin the usage-site form-group options. A usage-site `onSubmitInvalid`\nproperty overrides the default even when explicitly set to `undefined`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst formGroupDefaults: DefaultFormGroupOptions = {\n  onSubmitInvalid: ({ groupApi }) => {\n    console.error('Invalid group', groupApi.name)\n  },\n}\n```\n"}
